### Mandatory Troubleshooting

- [x] Use the LATEST version of the mod and ALL its dependencies (or ideally all your mods). Pro tip: don't install mods manually, use a launcher.
- [x] Don't use Optifine or hybrid servers (Mohist/Velocity/etc) and have tried without big game altering mods (Sodium/Lithium/etc).
- [x] Check that this bug hasn't been reported already.
- [x] Try with the mod alone. If issue does not persist then try removing half of your mods at the time to find the conflicting mod.

### Minecraft Version & Loader

1.21.1-NEOFORGE

### Issue

The claret sign from JNE for some reason cannot have its texture found to do the pixel consistency for amendments... I've looked in the files of JNE and the claret sign texture and hanging sign texture seem to be in the right spot where they should be...

### Logs & Media

6:36:52] [pool-25-thread-4/ERROR] [Moonlight/]: Failed to generate texture amendments:block/signs/netherexp/sign_claret: java.lang.RuntimeException: java.io.IOException: Failed to open texture at location minecraft:entity/signs/netherexpclaret: no such file
[16:36:52] [pool-25-thread-1/WARN] [Amendments/]: Failed to generate hanging sign extension texture for netherexp:claret, 
java.io.IOException: Failed to open texture at location minecraft:entity/signs/hanging/netherexpclaret: no such file
