### BEFORE CONTINUING:

- [x] Always check you are using the latest version of these mods and its dependencies
- [x] Remove known problematic rendering mods such as Optifine, Sodium and others

### Version-Loader

1.21-neoforge

### Moonlight Lib Version

moonlight-1.21-2.29.10

### Issue Detail

When loading up a world when running with Moonlight but *not* with Quark it throws errors as it appears to be trying to reference Quark items without first checking if Quark is even loaded in the first place.

It doesn't cause a crash, but it definitely makes the logs irritatingly difficult to read.

